  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonar Music SA &#xfffd; SommerOase 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The network activity involves three core volunteer leaders from Sonar Music South Africa traveling to Denmark to take part in SommerOase, a national camp hosted by DanskOase. Sonar Music DK runs the live concert line at the camp, where the team will assist with sound, lighting, and production. This offers hands-on learning and a platform to raise awareness about the global Sonar project. The activity targets youth aged 18&#xfffd;30 and creates space for skill-building, cultural exchange, and volunteer recruitment.</narrative>
  </description>
